{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc",
    "description": "Conservative finite-volume variable-coefficient vertical diffusion d/dz(K du/dz) on column_nonuniform_1d with the coefficient K on the INTERFACES and consumer-supplied VALUES of u on the two domain faces (the Dirichlet-boundary analogue of rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc, which takes prescribed fluxes). The consumer writes the compound D( {op:*, args:[K, D(u, wrt: lev)]}, wrt: lev ) -- coefficient on the LEFT of the product (matching is structural and non-commutative) -- and the rule fires on the whole compound at priority 10 (esm-spec 9.6.3 outermost-first compound precedence) before any plain-D rule can lower the inner derivative; it is match-scoped with where {u: {shape: [lev]}, K: {shape: [lev_nodes]}} (esm-spec 9.6.1), so it fires only when the state is a bare layer field and the coefficient a bare interface field of THIS grid. Every flux in the operator is the ONE interface flux G[n] = K[n] (u[n]-u[n-1])/(zc[n]-zc[n-1]) of stencils/interface_flux_K_lev, and the two domain-face fluxes close the same law against the boundary VALUES: G[1] = K[1] (u[1]-u_sfc)/(zc[1]-z_sfc) at the surface face and G[NLEV+1] = K[NLEV+1] (u_top-u[NLEV])/(z_top-zc[NLEV]) at the top face (stencils/interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc, the same template a consumer applies directly to read a face flux, e.g. a basal conductive flux -G[NLEV+1]). Interior [2, NLEV-1]: the imported stencil, (G[k+1] - G[k]) / dz[k]; boundary layers: L u[1] = ( G[2] - G[1] ) / dz[1] and L u[NLEV] = ( G[NLEV+1] - G[NLEV] ) / dz[NLEV]. Free-name contract (resolved in the consuming model): the grid geometry observeds zc, dz (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm), the domain-face coordinates z_sfc = ze[1], z_top = ze[NLEV+1] (shared with the integral rules), and the boundary values u_sfc (at the surface face) and u_top (at the top face) -- the names are POSITIONAL (ze[1] and ze[NLEV+1], ze increasing with the lev index), so a model whose vertical coordinate runs top-down (e.g. the CISM sigma column, with the ice surface at ze[1] = z_sfc = 0 and the bed at ze[NLEV+1] = z_top) satisfies the contract directly without reversing its arrays, the surface value entering the face at ze[1] and the bed value the face at ze[NLEV+1]. Because every interior flux enters the column sum once with each sign, the operator telescopes exactly: sum_k dz[k] L u[k] = G[NLEV+1] - G[1], the difference of the two boundary-value fluxes, so the column integral of u changes only through the two domain faces. The scheme is the node-centered conservative finite-volume diffusion of LeVeque section 2.13 on a stretched column -- exactly the dups stencil of the CISM temperature solve (glissade_therm.F90:151-163, 1410-1418 glissade_temperature_matrix_elements) with a constant per-column K -- second-order in L2 on a smoothly stretched column (supraconvergent); reduces to the classical three-point form on a uniform column with uniform K.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:varcoeff_laplacian",
      "axes:lev",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:3",
      "bc:dirichlet",
      "spec:9.6.8"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.13 (nonuniform grids)."
      },
      {
        "citation": "CISM (Community Ice Sheet Model) cism_main_3.00.002, libglissade/glissade_therm.F90 glissade_temperature_matrix_elements (F90:1324-1507) and the dups grid quantities (F90:151-163)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "../stencils/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior.esm" },
    { "ref": "../stencils/interface_flux_K_lev.esm" },
    { "ref": "../stencils/interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc": {
      "params": ["u", "K"],
      "priority": 10,
      "match": {
        "op": "D",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": ["K", { "op": "D", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "lev" }]
          }
        ],
        "wrt": "lev"
      },
      "where": {
        "u": { "shape": ["lev"] },
        "K": { "shape": ["lev_nodes"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[2, { "op": "-", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }]],
          [[1, 1]],
          [["NLEV", "NLEV"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior",
            "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K" }
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": 2 }
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc",
                    "bindings": {
                      "u_bc": "u_sfc",
                      "u_adj": { "op": "index", "args": ["u", 1] },
                      "K_face": { "op": "index", "args": ["K", 1] },
                      "z_bc": "z_sfc",
                      "z_adj": { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", 1] }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc",
                    "bindings": {
                      "u_bc": "u_top",
                      "u_adj": { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "NLEV"] },
                      "K_face": { "op": "index", "args": ["K", { "op": "+", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }] },
                      "z_bc": "z_top",
                      "z_adj": { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", "NLEV"] }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": "NLEV" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", "NLEV"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
